      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(zalo): bound proxy fetcher cache to 64 entries",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nFixes an issue where Zalo `resolveZaloProxyFetch` retained one `makeProxyFetch` entry per distinct proxy URL in a process-lifetime `Map` with no eviction. Config churn or high-cardinality proxy URLs could therefore grow gateway memory without a hard bound.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\n- Cap `proxyCache` at 64 entries using the shared `pruneMapToMaxSize` helper after every successful insert (same pattern as Nextcloud Talk room cache / MS Teams team-group cache / Mattermost opaque-target cache).\n- Insertion-order eviction keeps newest proxy fetchers; cache-hit identity and empty-URL behavior are unchanged.\n- Adds a focused regression that fills `max+1` distinct URLs, proves the oldest entry is rebuilt on next use, and confirms a mid-window entry still hits.\n\nNo new config/env surface. Does not change Bot API timeouts (`#104017`) or other Zalo send paths.\n\n## User Impact\n\n**Before:** Long-running Zalo gateways could retain an unbounded number of proxy fetcher closures as distinct proxy URLs appeared.\n\n**After:** At most 64 distinct proxy fetchers are retained; older ones are dropped and rebuilt on next use.\n\n## Evidence\n\nHead: `4d348f869a9b7395123a205cc2545e1f1a3c0ea2`\n\n### Unit + executable negative control\n\n```bash\nnode scripts/run-vitest.mjs extensions/zalo/src/proxy.test.ts -- --run --reporter=verbose\n```\n\n```text\n[zalo proxyCache negative control] unbounded_size=65 unbounded_keeps_oldest=true bounded_size=64 bounded_evicts_oldest=true\n[zalo proxyCache proof] max=64 filled=65 oldest_evicted=true rebuilt=true mid_hit=true\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  5 passed (5)\n```\n\n### Real behavior proof (production path)\n\nNo `makeProxyFetch` mock. Calls production `resolveZaloProxyFetch` → SDK `makeProxyFetch` (Undici `ProxyAgent` wrappers) against 65 distinct loopback proxy URLs.\n\n```bash\nnode scripts/run-vitest.mjs extensions/zalo/src/proxy.proof.test.ts -- --run --reporter=verbose\n```\n\n```text\n[zalo proxyCache production proof] max=64 filled=65 oldest_evicted=true rebuilt=true mid_hit=true real_makeProxyFetch=true\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  1 passed (1)\n```\n\n- **Boundary crossed:** process-local Undici ProxyAgent-backed fetch wrappers (real `makeProxyFetch`), no fetch-runtime mock.\n- **Negative control:** plain Map without `pruneMapToMaxSize` retains oldest after 65 inserts; production path rebuilds oldest after the 64-entry cap.\n- **Siblings:** Nextcloud Talk / MS Teams / Mattermost `pruneMapToMaxSize` callers unchanged.\n- **CI note:** `checks-node-compact-small-1` fail on `test/scripts/test-extension.test.ts` (`readdirSync: 54`) is tooling flake unrelated to this Zalo surface.\n\nAI-assisted.\n",
        "branch": "fix/zalo-proxy-cache-cap",
